#[mlir::op("nvvm.wgmma.mma_async", format = "$descriptorA `,` $descriptorB `,` $inouts `,` $shape `,` `D` `[` $typeD `,` $scaleD (`,` $satfinite^)? `]` `,` `A` `[` $typeA `,` $scaleA `,` $layoutA `]` `,` `B` `[` $typeB `,` $scaleB `,` $layoutB `]` attr-dict `:` type($inouts) `->` type($results)", results(results))]
